OL,4,BStruggling Blackpool sack Evatt on his 
OL,5,Bbirthday                               
OL,6,GBlackpool have sacked head coach Ian   
OL,7,GEvatt on his 45th birthday after a     
OL,8,Gyear in charge following a run of one  
OL,9,Gwin and six defeats in their past 10   
OL,10,Gleague games.                          
OL,12,FEvatt's final match was Saturday's 1-0 
OL,13,Faway defeat by fellow strugglers AFC   
OL,14,FWimbledon, leaving the Tangerines      
OL,15,Fimmediately above the League One       
OL,16,Frelegation zone.                       
OL,18,FThat defeat, however, came after the   
OL,19,Fhe said his squad had been decimated   
OL,20,Fby a sickness bug during their trip to 
OL,21,Fthe capital.                           
